# Map XiangShan's ClockGate onto ASAP7's integrated clock gate.
#
# Runs through SYNTH_POST_HIERARCHY_SCRIPTS (patches/0068), after
# hierarchy and before flatten: the only window in which a ClockGate
# instance is still a cell of its own type.
#
# chtype first, because the slang frontend elaborates one module per
# instance and names it after the instance path (ClockGate$<path>), so
# there is no cell of type ClockGate for techmap to match and a bare
# techmap -map maps nothing. chtype folds the copies back onto the one
# name xs_icg_map.v defines. The VeeR flow does the same for its
# clockhdr (test/coremark_joule/flow/cmj_veer_icg.ys).
#
# SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
chtype -set ClockGate t:ClockGate$*
techmap -map test/coremark_joule/designs/asap7/xiangshan/xs_icg_map.v
